    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d839">

                <pb facs="1036" n="1018" xml:id="pg1018"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.504 Mexico/1–3146</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Mexico</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Messersmith</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                        <lb/> No. 28,212</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi>, D.F.</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1946-01-31">January 31, 1946</date>.<lb/>[Received February
                        7.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Reference is made to my Despatch No. 28,200
                    of January 29, 1946<anchor n="83" xml:id="d839-f1"/> … regarding illegal
                    entrants into the United States.</p>
                <p>I now have the honor to inform the Department that at my request Mr.
                        O’Donoghue<anchor n="84" xml:id="d839-f2"/> of the Embassy staff this
                    morning called on Dr. Manuel Tello, the Under Secretary for Foreign Affairs and
                    left with him an informal memorandum dated January 29, 1946, a copy of which is
                    attached hereto.<anchor n="83" xml:id="d839-f3"/> Mr. O’Donoghue discussed the
                    question of these illegal entrants into the United States with Dr. Tello and
                    there is attached a copy of a memorandum reporting this conversation.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">George</hi> S. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Messersmith</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d839-a1.xml" xpointer="d839-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
